{
  "id": "JOL.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "JOL",
  "reference": "Joel 1",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOL 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of Jehovah that came to Joel the son of Pethuel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear this, ye old men, and give ear, all ye inhabitants of the land. Hath this been in your days, or in the days of your fathers? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell ye your children of it, and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your children ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " their children, and their children another generation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That which the palmer-worm hath left hath the locust eaten; and that which the locust hath left hath the canker-worm eaten; and that which the canker-worm hath left hath the caterpillar eaten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awake, ye drunkards, and weep; and wail, all ye drinkers of wine, because of the sweet wine; for it is cut off from your mouth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For a nation is come up upon my land, strong, and without number; his teeth are the teeth of a lion, and he hath the jaw-teeth of a lioness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath laid my vine waste, and barked my fig-tree: he hath made it clean bare, and cast it away; the branches thereof are made white.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lament like a virgin girded with sackcloth for the husband of her youth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The meal-offering and the drink-offering are cut off from the house of Jehovah; the priests, Jehovah’s ministers, mourn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The field is laid waste, the land mourneth; for the grain is destroyed, the new wine is dried up, the oil languisheth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be confounded, O ye husbandmen, wail, O ye vinedressers, for the wheat and for the barley; for the harvest of the field is perished. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The vine is withered, and the fig-tree languisheth; the pomegranate-tree, the palm-tree also, and the apple-tree, even all the trees of the field are withered: for joy is withered away from the sons of men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gird yourselves ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and lament, ye priests; wail, ye ministers of the altar; come, lie all night in sackcloth, ye ministers of my God: for the meal-offering and the drink-offering are withholden from the house of your God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanctify a fast, call a solemn assembly, gather the old men ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " all the inhabitants of the land unto the house of Jehovah your God, and cry unto Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alas for the day! for the day of Jehovah is at hand, and as destruction from the Almighty shall it come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is not the food cut off before our eyes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", joy and gladness from the house of our God? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seeds rot under their clods; the garners are laid desolate, the barns are broken down; for the grain is withered. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How do the beasts groan! the herds of cattle are perplexed, because they have no pasture; yea, the flocks of sheep are made desolate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehovah, to thee do I cry; for the fire hath devoured the pastures of the wilderness, and the flame hath burned all the trees of the field. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, the beasts of the field pant unto thee; for the water brooks are dried up, and the fire hath devoured the pastures of the wilderness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JOL.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "JOL"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "HOS.14",
    "number": "14",
    "bookId": "HOS"
  }
}